WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:02.700
- So some are accusing Trump
lawyer Michael van der Veen

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:05.510
of stealing coasters
from the Senate floor.

00:00:05.510 --> 00:00:06.343
Let's watch.

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:09.640
Yeah, he seems to be taking some coasters.

00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:10.810
Though, we don't actually see him

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:12.380
walk away with the coasters.

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:14.770
Yeah, I mean, arguably
he's taking some coasters,

00:00:14.770 --> 00:00:17.160
but those coasters are there to be taken.

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:18.160
They're disposable.

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:20.190
And come on, if you're a
lawyer on the Senate floor,

00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:22.640
arguing your case in front of the country,

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:25.140
I think you deserve some
souvenirs to take home,

00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:27.100
some Senate embroidered coasters.

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:28.080
I think that's okay.

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:30.270
The Trump lawyers did a lot
that deserves criticism,

00:00:30.270 --> 00:00:32.770
but taking a handful of
coasters home as souvenirs,

00:00:32.770 --> 00:00:34.190
probably not one of them.

00:00:34.190 --> 00:00:36.110
But of course I would
say that, I'm a lawyer.

00:00:36.110 --> 00:00:39.010
And speaking of which, subscribe
or I'll see you in court.

